  "description": "Taisei Sengoku had suffered horrific violence at the hands of his step-mother and older brother, resulting in one of his eyes being gouged out. When he awoke in the hospital, he found that a strange eyeball had been transplanted into him. That eye belonged to none other than Sougen Kanzaki, a monstrous man who, during his lifetime, had harbored multiple personalities. And so, one of Sougen’s personalities began to take root within Taisei’s eye. At the same time, Sougen’s body, which had vanished from the funeral home, had been dissected and transplanted into multiple people. The recipients, who had inherited parts of Sougen’s body and separate personalities, began attacking Taisei one after another. The only way to survive is to defeat them all… Taisei’s life-or-death battle begins now!\n\n(Source: Piccoma, translated)",
